WEBVTT

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:25.580
To bathe is to cleanse the soul.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:31.620
Even at the Demon Castle, it's a comfort
allowed for both humans and demons alike.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:34.240
Even the captured princess is permitted to.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:37.620
However...

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.240
It's cramped.

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:47.950
I thought a little dream of mine
could come true at the Demon Castle.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:51.790
It's my dream to fall asleep in the tub alone.

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:55.700
Back at home, I regularly had ten
maids waiting on me when I bathed.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:01:01.960
Princess

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.700
Their joint efforts to maintain my creamy-white skin

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.620
meant that I never had a peaceful bath time.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.450
So I was looking forward to it here.

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:11.200
But this tiny tub <i>cannot</i> be for humans!

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:14.930
Unaware that being permitted
to bathe is hospitable treatment

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:14.950
I put up with it until now,

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.790
but I can't take it anymore!

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.040
For small demons (50 cm)

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:44.920
A few months ago

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:44.920
Reason

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:37.790
I'm to prepare for the bathing needs
of the princess we're to capture.

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.660
Huh? Princess?

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:43.450
Last time I saw her from a distance,
she was as teeny as a chicken.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:44.910
Idiot

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:44.910
Idiot

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:58.350
Post-bath fashion

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:57.870
I will make a wonderful
bathtub to leisurely sleep in!

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:02.020
"Quest"
"Bathtub for Leisurely Sleep"

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:36.990
"Fourth Night"
"The Princess, Destruction, and a Short Journey"

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:44.290
First, I need to re-pipe the hot water.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.290
My current water is lukewarm
and there isn't enough.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:50.000
Communal Demon Baths

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.580
That means...

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.540
Yeah! I feel so free stark naked!

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.140
Cam 1

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.290
Wh--?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.640
Cam 2

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.740
Wh--?!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.900
Cam 3

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:07.830
Wha--?!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.950
--Th-The princess is here!
--But why?!

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.790
Cover up! You know what I mean!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.370
Just kill me now.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:22.290
Wait, isn't that the castle's
communication pipeline?

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:25.660
Y-You think the princess is joining our bath?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.830
Yeah, right.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:41.040
What's this?

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.950
What's she doing? Huh?

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:45.540
Hey, the water stopped!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:57.290
Water level, check. Temperature, check.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.830
I've obtained hot water,
the essence of the bath!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.330
Pose of success

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.580
I need a bathtub, huh?

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.830
Obviously

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.330
But what to do?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:20.200
Ideally, I'd like one as large as a cauldron...

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:23.540
You dolt! How many times must I repeat myself?!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:26.910
I told you that open flames are strictly
prohibited near the Rocket Turtle!

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.580
Huh?

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.990
Rocket Turtle?

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:34.740
Rocket Turtle

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.540
Shell... That shell!

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.740
But how come?

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:44.990
You see, if the Rocket Turtle's
tail fuse is lit,

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:49.080
it becomes a rocket and
gets blown to smithereens.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:52.290
Fireballs are inexcusable!
Be careful from now on!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.410
Okay!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.830
I <i>just</i> said not to breathe fire!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.990
Goodness, you're all talk and no action!

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:02.290
Put yourself in my shoes, will you?

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:05.620
You hear? Fire is strictly prohibited!

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:06.830
Strictly prohibited!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.580
Rocket Turtle!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.080
Wh-What happened--

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.410
Ow...

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:41.660
<i>Obtained desired bathtub</i>

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:47.490
Now, to fill it with hot water
from the communal baths...

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.490
...and remove my clothes!

00:06:55.870 --> 00:07:01.450
It's done! Demon Castle Hell bath of my dreams!

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:05.580
Now to drink this icy healing potion.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:09.790
I can sleep in the tub liked I've dreamed about.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:13.950
This would've been impossible back home.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.830
How wonderful freedom is!

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.620
Zzz...

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:43.230
Quest Complete

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.540
Slept leisurely!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:49.330
No snacks for you until
you put the Rocket Turtle back!

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.330
Got that?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:56.960
"Great Red Siberian"
"Loyalty: ☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"
"Fluffiness: ☆☆☆☆☆☆"
"Beast demon."

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.700
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.740
Summer at the Demon Castle.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:04.410
It's a merciless combination
of soaring temperatures

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:09.330
along with magma flowing
throughout the entire castle.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.620
So... hot...

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:18.450
A truly hellish summer.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:21.240
What's wrong with this castle?!

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:27.200
They have magma flowing right from its source,
but they don't install air conditioners?

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:30.580
It was too hot to sleep last night.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.330
If I could at least eat something cool...

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.450
Princess, mealtime!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:42.990
Here you go! Sizzling stone-grilled steak!

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:45.240
Sound of dying soul

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.740
Princess!

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:52.040
So sorry, dearie. I can't use the ice right now.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:55.740
Make all the magma in the Demon Castle ice!

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:57.620
Make it ice!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:09:01.270
Ice Golem

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:00.950
We demand change!

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:03.160
Demand change!

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:06.240
We demand a better environment for ice demons!

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:08.290
Better environment!

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:11.790
Stop giving better treatment to fire demons!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.790
That's why.

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:16.700
--Every summer, the Ice Golem
leads demons from the Ice Area

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.740
Stop!

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.700
What are you gonna do if we melt?!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:23.040
in a squabble against fire demons
to change the castle magma to ice.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.830
What are you gonna do?!

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:23.040
Please let us freeze again!

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.700
Ice Area?

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:29.540
A freezing cold area that silences even clocks.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:32.620
Let us freeze!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:32.620
Everything freezes there.
It's not my kind of place.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.790
Get outta here, Ice Golem!

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:37.620
You tryin' to start a fight
with us fire demons?!

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:40.660
Hey, come quick!
We've gotta go suppress the fight!

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.080
Sorry, have to go.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.540
Shut up! You're so fiery!

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.830
You'll melt us! Get away!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:58.490
I didn't know there was an Ice Area.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:04.910
If I can obtain ice from there,
I'll be able to sleep in cool comfort.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.040
I will journey to the Ice Area.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:11.080
"Quest"
"Sleep in Cool Comfort"

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:22.410
An area covered in ice that's so frigid
that even clocks are silenced.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:26.910
I can't jump straight in with
just the clothes on my back.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:29.330
Wants to cool it

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:29.330
Thought it might be useful

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:37.040
I'll need armor that will insulate my
entire body but allows me to move freely.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:41.990
Where in the world can
I find something so handy?!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.830
Rubber

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.830
Rubber

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:50.120
Y-You there.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.200
Huh?

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:55.450
Random question. Are you hollow inside?

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:57.290
Yeah, I sure am.

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:00.410
Ooh? Really?

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:01.410
Hm?

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.490
"Princess"

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:19.740
<i>Obtained armor<i>!</i></i>

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.410
This is perfect!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:23.990
Demon Castle Ice Area: Frozen Downpour

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:33.910
I don't feel it. I don't feel cold at all!

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:42.790
Anyway, I just need to bring plenty
of ice back to cool my room.

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:45.120
So hot.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.620
It's hot 'cause you keep saying it.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:50.910
Hm? Isn't that the Tire Genie?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:55.780
Tire Genie's Gaseous Interior
(Formerly Tire Genie)

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:53.410
I feel light as a feather!

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:56.080
He's changed.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:12:05.410
Killer Snowman

00:11:55.780 --> 00:12:05.040
Demi Polar Bear

00:11:56.080 --> 00:12:00.240
The fire demons are arrogant as usual this year.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:05.120
Yeah. It's time to show them
what we ice demons are made of!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:05.160
Demi Polar Bear

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.790
Yeah!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:05.540
Killer Snowman

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:09.040
Huh? Ice Golem.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.910
Hey, Ice Golem. What happened, Captain?

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:15.490
You came back quick, Ice Golem.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:19.300
Ice Golem?

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:22.950
Your speech went well, right? What's next?

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.620
Come on, let's plan how to defeat the magma.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.490
Come along.

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:28.910
Huh? No, uh...

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:31.490
No, I...

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:33.740
Oh, the captain's returned!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:35.080
I'm not...

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.830
Captain!

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:41.660
We'll carry out any plan the captain
devises to bring down the magma!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:42.790
Quick, give us orders!

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.790
I'll do anything you order me to!

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:48.740
Anything?

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.160
Anything!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.160
Leave it to me!

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:56.200
Captain!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:06.790
Let's see, first operation is to make
an igloo in the captured princess' cell.

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:12.330
What does that have to do with magma?

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:17.240
Idiot! It means to build an
encampment outside of the Ice Area!

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:20.330
That's right.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.200
Got it!

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:27.740
Next, dispatch two to three
of those cute seals to the princess.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:38.420
Eggplant Seal

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.370
But why?!

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:34.620
Idiot! It's in order to give ice demons
a more positive image

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.700
so that our appeal to stop
the magma passes more easily.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:38.700
What?!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.120
That's right.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:42.950
Got it!

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:44.950
Captain, you're amazing!

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:46.540
--Wow!
--I knew we could count on him!

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.870
Captain! What's our next operation?

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.910
Yes, let's see.

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.990
Hey!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.450
Where is everyone?

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:55.950
Ice Golem (Real One)

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:58.120
Hm? You hear something?

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:00.370
Huh? Where'd the captain go?

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:01.740
Probably the bathroom.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:02.790
--Hm?
--What?

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:04.120
What's that sound?

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.160
We'll use this ice for the operation.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.950
Oh! Captain!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.490
How'd you get such high-quality ice so fast?

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.700
I whacked it with a frozen pillow.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:22.740
Say what?

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.490
I must take care of other plans now.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.830
Take orders from the princess while I'm away.

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:34.580
But why take orders from the princess?

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:35.910
Uh-oh.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:39.540
True... What authority does the princess have?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:43.490
It's strange, huh?

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:47.830
That princess is actually unofficially
appointed to be the next demon king.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.700
Seriously?!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.450
Her current form is a disguise.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:56.700
Wow! It'd do us good
to flatter the princess, then!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:00.540
Our captain's so well-informed!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.990
This is off the records.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:04.990
Something's up.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:09.790
Don't you think the Ice Area demons
are a little too quiet these days?

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:14.450
Oh, didn't you know, Quilly? Look there.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:28.040
I've obtained a marvelous air conditioner.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:29.950
See?

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.160
Jaw drop!

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:36.790
This unrivaled iciness!

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:40.870
I'm dreaming even on this sweltering night.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.450
Zzz...

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:52.680
Quest Complete

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.950
Sleeping in cool comfort!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:56.410
If we serve the princess well,
we'll stop the magma!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.540
The reign of ice demons is near!

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.410
She's totally using them.

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.490
The princess leads an enjoyable life.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:19.960
Former Ice Golem

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:14.950
No snacks for you until you put the Ice Golem back!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.870
And I'm confiscating the Eggplant Seals!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.580
Aw...

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:24.960
"Scissors Sorcerer"
"Mischievous: ☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"
"Harmonious: ☆☆☆"

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:23.200
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> !

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:32.620
I'm the captured princess,
Aurora Sya Lis Goodereste.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:35.950
On my way back from procuring a certain item,

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:41.950
I witnessed a small demon
sleeping upon a fluffy tummy.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:46.330
It made me so jealous
that I used a shrinking item...

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.240
Apport Hourglass

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:51.240
...without noticing the hidden trap.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.290
Then the item took effect.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:17:05.910
When I opened my eyes, my body had shrunken.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.370
This wasn't the type of shrinking I'd expected!

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:10.130
Expected

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.950
Well, I'll change back eventually.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.240
Optimistic

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:18.160
Might as well go back and sleep.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:27.450
It's too heavy to lift?

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:34.200
My clothes...

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:38.370
Jumped down from there

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:41.240
I can't return to my bed!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.410
More to the right. The right!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:48.330
Jeez, this is work for flying demons!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.290
I know, right?

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:53.080
Found a ladder!

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:56.540
All right! A little more to the right, Minotaur!

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.580
Got it.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:58.950
No, to the left.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.910
Huh? The left?

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.490
Then back up.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.870
Huh? Back up?

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.660
Hey! Where are you going?!

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.450
Now's my chance!

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:08.700
Huh? Wha--?!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:09.400
What's going on?!

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:10.080
What's wrong?

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.910
No idea! Something's--

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:15.910
Good. If I climb just a little more...

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:21.790
It's the princess.

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:22.950
Yup, it's the princess.

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:28.380
Got a potion candy

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.740
Is your injury feeling better?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:32.290
So how come she got all tiny?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:35.490
Oh, must've been this item.

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:38.240
Only time will turn her back, then.

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:40.330
Well? Where were you heading?

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:46.700
Talk!

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:50.370
Come to think of it, I was a quiet child.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:54.200
What're we gonna do?
It'd be a pain if we reported it.

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:57.240
Let's put her back into her cell for now.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.330
Upsy-daisy.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.330
How fortunate. I can return to my room now.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:11.990
Oh shoot. This is the first time
I've ever held a human child!

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:16.240
Humans usually run at
first sight of me, naturally!

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:19.660
D-Dillo, let me! Let me try, too!

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:24.700
Oh, the princess shrank! Lucky!

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.160
Let me carry her, too! Just for a little!

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:31.120
This isn't going in the right direction.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:36.120
At this rate, it'll turn into a
"fawn over the small child fiasco,"

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:33.540
How'd she shrink?

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.120
Looks like she turned the Apport Hourglass.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.950
Oh, that's why.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.950
and then I may never reach my bed!

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:41.160
The princess used to be this small, huh?

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:41.160
What should I do?

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:46.160
Princess, come here!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.160
Ouch!

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:48.290
Critical

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:48.330
Critical

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.210
Critical

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:50.700
Minotaur!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.330
Yeowch!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.330
Ouch!

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:57.040
Guys!

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:02.700
Go now!

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:08.290
I acquired a good taxi.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:12.450
Comes with weapons, too.
There shouldn't be any issues now.

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:16.370
Princess, you stole items again, didn't you?!

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:17.830
Yeowch!

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:24.120
"Area Boss"

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:24.120
100 damage per needle

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:27.160
<i>Fight</i>

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:27.160
<i>Item</i>

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:25.870
<i>Run</i>

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:27.160
<i>Can't escape!</i>

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:30.790
Sh-She shrank!

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.080
Be my granddaughter!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:41.490
Thus, the shrunken princess's
adventure ended reluctantly.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:42.490
However...

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:49.740
She's not very talkative.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:52.330
It'd be easier if she were always like this.

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.790
I'll return the item to the treasury.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.450
Let me hold her, too!

00:20:56.780 --> 00:21:05.790
Fawn Over the Small Child Fiasco

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.790
Oh, she's so tiny!

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:01.410
Ooh, my turn! My turn!

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:03.290
Hey, you sure it's okay?

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:06.080
Don't small children break at the touch?!

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.870
Demon King, care to give it a try?

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.290
Nuh-uh! Nope. It's scary.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.910
Come now, there's nothing to be scared of.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.200
Nope! I'm fine just watching from here.

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:18.290
Look how well-behaved she is.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:23.700
You know how she normally is.
This is your only chance.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:28.200
This isn't what I expected at all.

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:32.620
It's different from that small demon's bed...

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:39.410
Well, this might be sleep that
I can have only when I'm small.

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:45.910
Yes... a child's deep, deep sleep
after a full day of playing.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:51.160
Zzz...

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:02.290
Sleep tight.

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:11.980
Quills grew back in a week

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:08.490
I can use those quills.

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:09.990
You're not yanking any more!

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:46.160
The Demon Castle is often described
as being in the dead of night

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:48.080
or covered in a deadly silence.

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:52.080
Though it is night at the castle,
it's recently very lively.

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:54.700
Next time, "The Princess and Female Warriors."

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:56.080
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
